ile idle!</strong> Embark on an enchanting journey accompanied by adorable monsters crafted with captivating 2D pixel art, and enjoy relaxed yet deeply satisfying gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Easy Idle Gameplay &amp; Boss System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character continuously grows and battles automatically without requiring complex controls. Defeat waves of monsters to summon formidable field bosses, then conquer them to progress to higher stages filled with valuable resources and generous rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709830/extras/a1a32cac8c267e67e6a85bb10f496ac4.avif?t=1759302964\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709830/extras_big/a1a32cac8c267e67e6a85bb10f496ac4.avif?t=1759302964 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Collect and Enhance Diverse Equipment &amp; Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather various pieces of equipment and unique skills as you progress through stages. Strengthen and customize your hero to enjoy the rewarding sensation of constant growth and empowerment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709830/extras/c2c85aaa39ee2e72a9b3fbf70da942e5.avif?t=1759302964\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709830/extras_big/c2c85aaa39ee2e72a9b3fbf70da942e5.avif?t=1759302964 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Exciting Raids &amp; Dungeon Challenges</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond regular stage adventures, exciting raids and challenging dungeons await you, filled with special equipment and rare rewards. Engage in strategic battles against powerful foes, accelerate your hero's growth, and experience deeper, thrilling gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709830/extras/1fcd99f3b3b2f9e401edb1c2eefc952f.avif?t=1759302964\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709830/extras_big/1fcd99f3b3b2f9e401edb1c2eefc952f.avif?t=1759302964 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","developers":["MYMEStudio inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709830/af0bc0f30c6ac09e3a4ef75d535a5fb0ce742b3e/header.jpg?t=1759302964","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3709830/1896308946/fc35adfa0b1cc3dc02b1be7ee91553bfc256eff4/1750427580/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747123384","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3709830/1896308946/fc35adfa0b1cc3dc02b1be7ee91553bfc256eff4/1750427580/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747123384","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3709830/1896308946/fc35adfa0b1cc3dc02b1be7ee91553bfc256eff4/1750427580/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747123384","id":25713722